==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - head:
      - type: head
      - css_main:
          - type: css
          - inline: |
              body{color:red;}
          - link: styles.css
==== expected output ====
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>
body{color:red;}
</style><meta name="generator" content="HyperBricks"></head><body></body></html>
